  "name": "Black Bean Tortilla Soup",
  "subtitle": "A hearty, spiced bean soup with crisp tortilla accents",
  "description": "Simmer black beans, tomatoes, peppers, and warming spices with cornmeal for a thick, satisfying soup. Finish with tortillas and fresh toppings.",
